WEBVTT

00:04:26.804 --> 00:04:31.434
The southwest part of Syria
was very difficult to access

00:04:31.475 --> 00:04:34.854
because it was surrounded
by regime forces.

00:04:35.187 --> 00:04:36.689
That was a gap.

00:04:37.523 --> 00:04:41.068
Israel shares a border
with that part of Syria.

00:04:41.110 --> 00:04:42.320
And guess what?

00:04:42.653 --> 00:04:45.865
It's easy to get aid into southwest Syria

00:04:45.906 --> 00:04:49.035
from the Israeli side
of the Golan Heights.

00:04:49.076 --> 00:04:53.539
That gave us something doable
with which to fill that gap.

00:04:53.914 --> 00:04:55.791
All we needed was the how.

00:04:56.459 --> 00:05:00.004
And that's why my colleagues
and I found ourselves